---
description: CAP repository conventions for Cursor agents
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`. Summary:

- Node 20+ ESM, zero runtime deps by default
- Domain logic in `src/{search,registry,use,mcp-bind,mcp-client,input-schema,inspector,skills,setup,optimize,inject,mcp-server,mcp-tools}.js`; keep CLI/Web thin
- Catalog edits must keep Capability↔Provider refs bidirectional; validate against `data/catalog.schema.json`
- Prefer CLI `--json` and `CAP_HOME` temp dirs when testing
- Never expand default MCP tools beyond search/add/use without opt-in
- Public `src/index.js` stays search/add/use/inspect/loadCatalog/loadState
- Run `npm run check` before finishing
